    \begingroup\edef\sys{\endgroup\detokenize{3&2\\3&-1}}
    \syntaxtableau{\sys}{x&y}{3&1}
    \end{lstlisting}

  % Print the solution
  \solution
}

\exampleLinearSystem
\end{lstlisting}

The resulting solution would be:

$$ \begin{pmatrix}
  x \\
  y
\end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix}
  1 \\
  1
\end{pmatrix} $$

\section{Part 2: Visualizing Data with pgfplots and tikz}

Visualizing data can provide valuable insights and help communicate complex ideas. Let's examine some examples using the packages pgfplots and tikz.

\subsection{Example 3: Plotting Data from a CSV File}

